{'symbol': 'BAC', 'date': '2021-07-19 09:00:00', 'title': 'BANK OF AMERICA LAUNCHES NEW UNLIMITED CASH REWARDS CREDIT CARD', 'text': "CHARLOTTE, N.C.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--BANK OF AMERICA TODAY ANNOUNCED THE LAUNCH OF THE BANK OF AMERICA UNLIMITED CASH REWARDS CREDIT CARD, WHICH ALLOWS CLIENTS TO EARN UNLIMITED 1.5% CASH BACK ON ALL PURCHASES. THIS NEW CREDIT CARD IS THE LATEST AMONG BANK OF AMERICA'S SUITE OF REWARDS CARDS, EACH DESIGNED TO FIT A VARIETY OF CLIENTS' NEEDS. “WE HEARD FROM OUR CLIENTS THAT THEY WANT EARNING REWARDS ON THEIR CREDIT CARD TO BE UNCOMPLICATED,” SAID JASON GAUGHAN, CREDIT CARD EXECUTIVE AT BANK OF AMER"}